# iOS -> Android sync manifest for the Songyan IME port.
# Line format: <ios-repo-relative path> <this-repo-relative path>
# A trailing slash means "copy the contents of the directory recursively".
# Paths are compared byte-for-byte by scripts/check-ios-sync.sh; do not edit the
# files listed here by hand (see CONTRIBUTING.md, "Project rules").

